<title>PORTUGAL: Bayerische launches 10 bln esc, 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Bayerische launches 10 bln esc, 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager and bookrunner Deutsche Bank de Investimento.</p>
<p>    BORROWER  Bayerische Vereinsbank    AMT 10 billion esc</p>
<p>    MATURITY  10 year   ISS PRICE Par   PAY DATE  25.2.97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY Aa2 for subordinated debt</p>
<p>PAY FREQ  Six-monthly</p>
<p>INTEREST Lisbor plus 20 basis points with upper limit of 8.25 percent and lower of five percent.</p>
<p>    LISTING Lux	   GOV LAW UK</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
